<?xml version="1.0"?>
<model>
  <name>cand_bullet</name>
  <version>1.0</version>
  <sdf version="1.9">model.sdf</sdf>

  <author>
    <name>Interceptor Project</name>
    <email>hamidiyeavcidrone0@gmail.com</email>
  </author>

  <description>
    Mermi/roket govdeli yuksek hizli C-UAS interceptor quadrotor — TARETSIZ ham govde.

    Kaynak: ~/Masaustu/deneme/interceptor_project/models/bullet_interceptor
    Dikey silindirik govde (r = 0.08 m, h = 0.50 m, m = 1.8 kg), alt-orta
    bolgeden cikan 4 kollu X yerlesim, burunda ileri/asagi bakan hedef kilit
    kamerasi, IMU ve ArduPilot SITL eklentisi (ArduCopter Quad-X, FDM 9002/9003).

    Bu klasor ELLE DEGISTIRILMEZ: taretli surum bundan uretilir.
    Uretici : scripts/21_build_bullet_interceptor.py
    Uretilen: models/interceptors/bullet_net_interceptor/
  </description>
</model>
